  "html": "<!-- TODO (EJ): add your voice. Live at outlastmap.com (2026-07-30). Client work\n     w/ Outlast (Eric Markowitz) — confirm credit/what's public. The May 2026\n     screenshots catalog (~/screenshots/catalogs/2026-05-b.md) has trip-planner\n     hero shots from 05-29 worth adding. Draft until ready. -->\n<p class=\"\">Companion website for the book Outlast — a curated database and map of businesses that have been operating for 100+ years (Zildjian, founded 1623, has a page), with a trip planner that builds multi-day itineraries around visiting the survivors. Nuxt 3 + DuckDB-WASM.</p>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"Outlast — businesses operating for 100+ years\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/outlast/landing.png\" alt=\"Outlast — businesses operating for 100+ years\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/outlast/landing.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/outlast/landing.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/outlast/landing.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/outlast/landing.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"Outlast — businesses operating for 100+ years\" width=\"1440\" height=\"829\" style=\"--splay-rot:-1.07deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1440×829\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay aspect-video w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">Outlast — businesses operating for 100+ years</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure role=\"figure\" aria-label=\"The deck.gl globe and the typed data model behind the map\" class=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/outlast/code.png\" alt=\"The deck.gl globe and the typed data model behind the map\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_640/projects/outlast/code.png 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_960/projects/outlast/code.png 960w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1280/projects/outlast/code.png 1280w, https://res.cloudinary.com/ejf/image/upload/c_scale,f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1920/projects/outlast/code.png 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 430px) 92vw, (max-width: 768px) 85vw, 900px\" title=\"The deck.gl globe and the typed data model behind the map\" width=\"1400\" height=\"900\" style=\"--splay-rot:1.47deg;\" data-dimensions=\"1400×900\" class=\"img-full my-8 rounded-sm img-splay w-full mx-auto py-4\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<figcaption class=\"\">The deck.gl globe and the typed data model behind the map</figcaption>\n</figure>",
